# This repo has no single shared .env — each app has its own, because
# each one deploys separately and needs different secrets:
#
#   apps/api/.env       backend secrets (database, JWT signing keys, later payment/storage keys)
#   apps/web/.env.local  public web config (NEXT_PUBLIC_* only — never a secret)
#   apps/mobile/.env     public mobile config (EXPO_PUBLIC_* only — never a secret)
#
# Copy each app's .env.example to .env (or .env.local for Next.js) and
# fill in real values there. Never commit a real .env file.
